{"ID":"20240205172805-uyjtd6j","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205172805-uyjtd6j","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172805-uyjtd6j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172820-8ua22rb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172818-23wgwqf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172820-8ua22rb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:127,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:127\u0026#125;","title":"北豆根","type":"doc","updated":"20240830155119"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205172820-8ua22rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172820-8ua22rb","updated":"20240205172825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产山东、山西、河北等地。\n【性状】\t根茎圆柱形，弯曲，有分枝，长可达50cm，直径0.3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0.8cm。表面黄棕色至暗棕色，多有弯曲的细根及纵皱纹，外皮易剥落。质韧，不易折断，断面不整齐，纤维性，木部黄色，呈放射状排列，中心有髓。气微，味苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有小毒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，消肿利咽。用于火毒蕴结，咽喉肿痛，齿龈肿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240205172811-67il4nf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172811-67il4nf","updated":"20240205172811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205172811-hj3zee6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710124040-wgdekle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710124040-wgdekle","updated":"20240710125548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"北豆根 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{